                <pb facs="0490" n="372" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg372"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/797: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-11-25T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 25,
                                1927—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>383. Your 984, November 10, 4 p.m. Treasury Department states that Nicholson has
                    been directed to proceed to Peking to assist American delegate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
